  and uh the jumbo jet um has continued uh  not very not changed very much  we fly in the same way as we did 50  years ago so  some technologies fizzle out because  there's no demand some  evolve rather slowly  whereas some uh like  ai and the technology in our smartphones  evolve very very fast and they raise  challenges that we've got to cope with  to continue watching this video click  the link in the top left or in the  description below or visit iai dot tv  for more debates and talks from the  world's leading thinkers on today's  biggest ideas

